s" class="section-nav__tab" role="tab">翻譯</a></li></ul></nav><section class="dict-section xxjs-section" id="xxjs" data-section="詞語解釋" data-lazy data-show-citations="on"><header class="dict-section__header"><h2 class="dict-section__title"><span class="dict-section__char">謙稱</span> 詞語解釋 </h2></header><div class="dict-section__body"><div class="sense-group sense-group--xxjs" id="sense-xxjs" data-sense-type="xxjs"><div class="xxjs-reading-head"><span class="xxjs-reading__word">謙稱</span><span class="xxjs-reading__py">qiān chēng</span><button class="audio-btn audio-btn--sm" type="button" data-audio="https://img.zdic.net/audio/zd/py/qi%C4%81n.mp3,https://img.zdic.net/audio/zd/py/ch%C4%93ng.mp3" aria-label="播放qiān chēng"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="11,5 6,9 2,9 2,15 6,15 11,19"/><path d="M15.54 8.46a5 5 0 010 7.07"/></svg></button><span class="xxjs-reading__zy">ㄑㄧㄢ ㄔㄥ</span></div><ol class="xxjs-list"><li class="xxjs-item"><div class="xxjs-item__def"> 表示謙遜的稱謂。 </div><div class="xxjs-citation"><span class="xxjs-block-label xxjs-block-label--cit">書證</span><ul class="xxjs-citation__list"><li class="xxjs-citation__item"><span class="xxjs-citation__text">孤、寡、不穀，諸侯謙稱。</span><span class="xxjs-citation__dash">——</span><cite class="xxjs-citation__source">晉·杜預《左傳注》</cite></li></ul></div><div class="xxjs-english"><span class="xxjs-block-label xxjs-block-label--en">英文</span><span class="xxjs-english__text">humble term</span></div></li><li class="xxjs-item"><div class="xxjs-item__def"> 用謙虛的言辭表達。 </div><div class="xxjs-citation"><span class="xxjs-block-label xxjs-block-label--cit">書證</span><ul class="xxjs-citation__list"><li class="xxjs-citation__item"><span class="xxjs-citation__text">小娥謙稱一句，就獻一盃。</span><span class="xxjs-citation__dash">——</span><cite class="xxjs-citation__source">《初刻拍案驚奇》</cite></li></ul></div><div class="xxjs-english"><span class="xxjs-block-label xxjs-block-label--en">英文</span><span class="xxjs-english__text">speak modestly</span></div></li></ol></div><div class="dict-section__footer"><a href="#" class="feedback-link copyright" data-section-auto="1">反饋</a></div></div></section><ins class="adsbygoogle ad-slot--inline" style="display:block" data-ad-client="ca-pub-5789084355642416" data-ad-slot="1583326394" data-ad-format="auto" data-full-width-responsive="true"></ins> <script>(adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});</script> <section class="dict-section guoyu-section" id="gyjs" data-gy-lv="0" data-section="國語辭典" data-lazy data-show-citations="on"><header class="dict-section__header"><h2 class="dict-section__title"><span class="dict-section__char">謙稱</span> 國語辭典 </h2></header><div class="dict-section__body"><div class="sense-group sense-group--guoyu" id="sense-guoyu" data-sense-type="guoyu"><div class="gy-reading"><header class="gy-reading__head"><span class="gy-reading__char">謙稱</span><span class="gy-reading__py">qiān chēng</span><button class="audio-btn audio-btn--sm" type="button" data-audio="https://img.zdic.net/audio/zd/py/qi%C4%81n.mp3,https://img.zdic.net/audio/zd/py/ch%C4%93ng.mp3" aria-label="播放qiān chēng"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="11,5 6,9 2,9 2,15 6,15 11,19"/><path d="M15.54 8.46a5 5 0 010 7.07"/></svg></button><span class="gy-reading__zy">ㄑㄧㄢ ㄔㄥ</span></header><div class="gy-sense-list" data-count="1"><div class="gy-sense"><div class="gy-sense__body"><p class="gy-sense__def">謙遜的稱呼，通常用以表示謙虛。</p><div class="xxjs-also"><span class="xxjs-block-label xxjs-block-label--also">例如</span><span class="xxjs-also__text">如：<span class="jbjs-quote">「他因年紀較長，所以謙稱自己為愚兄。」</span></span></div><div class="xxjs-also"><span class="xxjs-block-label xxjs-block-label--ant">反義詞</span><span class="xxjs-also__text"><a href="/hans/%E6%95%AC%E7%A7%B0" class="syn-tag">敬称</a></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="